少年一代中最有天赋的奇才。因为凰家祖父对西川国有功，所以本尊凰冷月从小就和连城魅订亲。这也更加重了凰冷月的花痴程度，当她得知连城魅不想娶她的时候，竟然自贬身份要求只要嫁给他。这种做法令凰家沦为整个西川国的笑柄。凰冷月的父亲更是气得要和她断绝父女关系。可是豁出去的凰冷月不但没有后悔反而觉得这是为了爱情牺牲。可是她的天真被摔得粉碎。新婚夜晚，凰冷月没有等到痴心爱恋的连城魅，等到的却是两个来想侮辱她的家丁！真正的凰冷月不堪侮辱，一头撞在柱子上而死，幸好老天长眼，让她魂穿在这个可怜女人身上……无疑，她凰冷月魂穿了。本尊不是什么受尽千万宠爱的千金小姐，却是受尽世人白眼和耻笑的废柴，胆小怯懦，畏缩无能的嫡女大小姐！而且死法还是最窝囊的一种：被心爱的男人新婚夜抛弃，自尽而死！凰冷月咬牙，既然是老天安排，那么，这具身体所承受的鄙夷、嘲讽、侮辱，将由她替她一一讨回来！前世她爱错了男人，得到了背叛和毁灭。这具身体也是如此。既然老天再给她和她一次机会，她绝对不会再重蹈覆辙！凰冷月冷笑：“趁我现在还没有杀人的心情，你们给我滚！”两个大汉你看我，我看你，忽然复而大笑。其中一个胖乎乎的家丁奸笑道，“凰冷月，爷们两可是魅国公跟前的红人。你不过是个任人践踏的小妾，你若服侍好了爷们俩，爷儿俩……”“啪啪！”还不等那醉汉污言秽语说完，凰冷月快如闪电耳光就直接招呼过来，直扇的年长家丁找不到北。身子在当地转了几个圈，狠狠跌倒在地。“你个小废物，找死！”见大哥被打，另一名醉汉家丁一脸愤怒的朝凰冷月大拳招呼过去，凰冷月无一丝灵力，他不需花费任何灵力，就可以分分钟打倒她。但是醉汉拳头要触碰到凰冷月的脸时，诡异的一幕发生了，凰冷月冷笑，飞脚带风起，一脚迅速向大汉的秘密基地踢去。“怦怦”接连两个漂亮的飞旋脚朝着两家丁的手腕脚腕呼啸而起。咔嚓，一声骨头断节声起，伴着大汉凄惨冲天的惨叫。“额，你……”大汉额头滴汗，霎时脸色**。整个人瘫痪在地，基地血流不止，痛不欲生。凰冷月睥睨两大汉，身子一跃空中，回旋中，小脚依葫芦画瓢照着另一位家丁踢去。一瞬间，快的几乎连眨眼的时间都不够，两名家丁竟然手经脚经尽毁不说，连生育能力都给生生剥夺了去。“你们不是欺负女人很爽吗？我今晚就让你们好好爽一爽！”凰冷月一脚一个踩上家丁断了的手腕，冷笑狠狠碾了下去。杀猪一样的叫声又一次响起……", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/fengnitian-shashoukuangfei/3.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 3 Let you have a taste of the power! Huang Lengyue: Xichuan Kingdom, honorary prince—the legitimate daughter of Prince Ning! He has been pampered in every way since he was a child, but this good luck lasted until he was three years old. Three-year-old aura test, zero! The spiritual power test at the age of seven was still zero! The eleven-year-old spiritual power test was still zero! Since then, she has gone from being the proud child of heaven to becoming a super loser who has never been seen before or since in the Xichuan Kingdom. Waste material is just waste material. But since she was a child, she has been obsessed with Xichuan Kingdom, the most handsome and noble prince - Liancheng Mei! He is the most talented young man in the Xichuan Kingdom. He is currently cultivating the fourth-level spiritual power of the wind system. He is the most talented prodigy among the young generation of Xichuan. Because the Huang family's grandfather had made great contributions to the Xichuan Kingdom, Huang Lengyue had been engaged to Liancheng Mei since he was a child. This also made Huang Lengyue's nymphomaniac even more severe. When she learned that Lian Chengmei didn't want to marry her, she devalued herself and asked to marry him. This approach made the Huang family the laughing stock of the entire Xichuan Kingdom. Huang Lengyue's father was so angry that he wanted to sever the father-daughter relationship with her. But Huang Lengyue, who risked her life, not only did not regret it, but felt that it was a sacrifice for love. But her innocence was shattered. On their wedding night, Huang Lengyue did not wait for the infatuated Liancheng Mei, but instead waited for two servants who wanted to insult her! The real Huang Lengyue couldn't bear the insult and hit her head against a pillar and died. Fortunately, God was wise and allowed her soul to live in this poor woman... There is no doubt that her soul was born in Huang Lengyue. I am not a rich young lady who is favored by millions of people, but a loser who is looked down upon and ridiculed by the world, a timid, timid and incompetent eldest daughter! And the way to die is the most useless way: being abandoned by the man you love on the wedding night and committing suicide! Huang Lengyue gritted her teeth. Since it was God's arrangement, then she would take back all the contempt, ridicule, and insults this body had endured on her behalf! In her previous life, she fell in love with the wrong man and was betrayed and destroyed. So is this body. Now that God gives her another chance, she will never make the same mistake again! Huang Lengyue sneered: \"Get out of here while I'm not in the mood to kill yet!\" The two big men looked at each other and suddenly started laughing again. One of the chubby servants smiled evilly and said, \"Huang Lengyue, you two are popular people in front of Duke Mei. You are just a concubine who can be trampled on by others. If you can serve me well, my son and I...\" \"Papa!\" Before the drunken man could finish his dirty words, Huang Lengyue greeted him with a lightning-quick slap in the face. The older servant who was slapped could not be found. His body spun around a few times and fell hard to the ground. \"You little loser, you're looking for death!\" Seeing his elder brother being beaten, another drunken servant punched Huang Lengyue with an angry look on his face. Huang Lengyue didn't have any spiritual power, so he could defeat her in minutes without spending any spiritual power. But when the drunkard's fist was about to touch Huang Lengyue's face, a strange scene happened. Huang Lengyue sneered, kicked up the wind, and quickly kicked towards the big man's secret base. \"Thump, thump,\" two beautiful spinning feet roared towards the wrists and ankles of the two guests. There was a crack, the sound of broken bones, accompanied by the miserable scream of the big man rising to the sky. \"Uh, you...\" The big man's forehead was dripping with sweat, and his face suddenly turned pale. The whole person was paralyzed on the ground, the base was bleeding, and he was in pain. Huang Lengyue looked at the two big men, jumped into the air, and while spinning, her little feet followed the pattern of a gourd and kicked the other servant. In an instant, so fast that it barely took the blink of an eye, the hands and feet of the two servants were completely destroyed, and even the ability to have children was deprived of them. \"Don't you feel good about bullying women? I'll let you feel so good tonight!\" Huang Lengyue stepped on the servant's broken wrist one by one, and crushed it hard with a sneer. The sound like a slaughtering pig sounded again...", "title_en": "Chapter 3"}